module DurableStatusModule is
    """
    Durable-store status probe: consults `uk_durable_snapshot_error` (the
    fail-visible corrupt-snapshot recovery report; empty on a clean open /
    no store) and `uk_durable_status` (the live-status JSON) through the
    CPS-JIT. Pure read-only consult — the module never mutates the store,
    so it cannot race the kernel's own writes.

    `run()` packs the consult results into the return value: the high 16
    bits are the live-status JSON byte count, the low 16 bits are the
    snapshot-recovery report byte count (0 = clean open / no store
    configured), and a negative value is a UK code (never happens for these
    consults).
    """
    function run(): Int64;
end module.
